---
description: Conventions for the Spring Boot 3 upgrade
globs: **/*.java
alwaysApply: false
---

When upgrading code to Spring Boot 3:

- Replace WebSecurityConfigurerAdapter with a SecurityFilterChain @Bean.
- Use authorizeHttpRequests and requestMatchers. Never use antMatchers or authorizeRequests.
- Move javax.persistence, javax.validation and javax.servlet imports to jakarta.
- Replace Spring Cloud Sleuth with Micrometer Tracing.
- Do not change public REST endpoint paths, request bodies or response bodies.
- Do not change files under src/main/resources/db/. Flag schema questions in the PR description instead.
- Run the module's tests after each change.